# Bug Reports – Demo Web Shop

## Project Overview
This folder contains bug report documentation prepared during Manual Testing of the Tricentis Demo Web Shop application.

**Application:** https://demowebshop.tricentis.com/

**Testing Type:** Functional Testing

**Testing Approach:** Manual Testing

## Objectives
- Identify and document application defects.
- Record detailed steps to reproduce defects.
- Compare expected and actual results.
- Assign severity and priority.
- Track defect status and retesting results.

## Bug Report Details
Each bug report includes:
- Bug ID
- Test Case ID
- Module
- Bug Title
- Preconditions
- Test Data
- Steps to Reproduce
- Expected Result
- Actual Result
- Severity and Priority
- Status
- Screenshots / Evidence
- Retesting Result

## Modules Covered
- User Registration and Login
- Product Search
- Product Comparison
- Wishlist
- Shopping Cart
- Checkout and Order Placement
- Address Management
- Order History

